-- [HE-PORT] Live-data adapter for the first Fuzz-style recoil prototype.
--
-- This table is deliberately based on the reviewed NLC weapon roster. It is
-- not an Anomaly classification layer and it does not add LTX metadata. The
-- numbers that describe a particular weapon are read from its live CWeapon
-- object after equip.

sivol_fuzz_recoil_profiles = sivol_fuzz_recoil_profiles or {}

